        <p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 12pt;">
          <span style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
            <span style="font-size: 16px;">Rover Pipeline LLC, as a limited liability company, records members' equity in Other Paid-In Capital.</span>
